// newtroLabelInputLine: newtLabelInputLine read-only (the NPR's newtROLabelInputLine):
// a label and the text of target.(path), which cannot be edited.
//
// This file holds newtroLabelInputLine and what only it reaches.

// flavor: the NewtApp filter that makes and reads the text (newtFilter)
// access 'readOnly: the value is shown and cannot be edited, and the label offers no picker
newtroLabelInputLine := {_proto: @newtProtoLine, flavor: @newtTextFilter, access: 'readOnly};
